	)
	(text "Power tree: VBAT (2S-6S) -> RPP P-FET -> TVS -> TPS54360B buck (+5V, 3.5 A, 597 kHz).\n+5V -> LM66100 ideal diode -> +5V_FMU (USB backs it up through a second LM66100 that the buck overrides).\n+5V_FMU -> TLV62569 -> +3V3 (MCU, SD, CAN VIO);  +5V_FMU -> LP5907 -> +3V3_SENS (IMUs, baro; MCU-switchable).\n+5V -> TPS2553 x2 -> +5V_PERIPH (UARTs, 1.2 A) and +5V_CAN (1.0 A): a shorted cable trips its own switch.\nCompensation values are checked in sim/buck (ngspice)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 395 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e52885d8-fd5f-5631-a7ba-d6102e8cf5da")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
